{
  "bodyHash": "163c5faaa20ef551",
  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcobblemon.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/aerodactyl_banner.png\" width=\"1980\" height=\"660\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Cobblemon 模組的官方整合包&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>適用於 Fabric</em></span></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2tsCcWbiYgA?si=zAfUCC1MLsPih05i\" width=\"700\" height=\"393\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></span></strong></em></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Cobblemon 功能（目前為止）：</span><br></strong></em></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>捕捉寶可夢以擴充你的隊伍，與野生寶可夢戰鬥以獲取經驗值，升級以解鎖新招式，並讓你的寶可夢進化。共有超過 700 種寶可夢可供捕捉！</li>\n<li>戰鬥採用&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokemonshowdown.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Pokémon Showdown!</em></a></span>&nbsp;引擎，提供精確的競技戰鬥機制。</li>\n<li>加入部分&nbsp;<em>寶可夢傳說 阿爾宙斯</em>風格的機制，例如招式重新學習、實體逃跑離開戰鬥，以及當<em>你</em>&nbsp;決定時讓寶可夢進化。</li>\n<li>可在戰鬥中切換自由移動模式。你可以在寶可夢戰鬥期間建造、採礦或對抗其他生物！</li>\n<li>使用寶可夢圖鑑記錄你看到和捕捉到的寶可夢。圖鑑還內建掃描功能，可分析野生寶可夢！</li>\n<li>騎乘你的寶可夢，以帥氣的方式探索 Minecraft 世界！</li>\n<li>你可以在多人遊戲中與朋友交換寶可夢並進行對戰。</li>\n<li>使用牧場讓你的寶可夢在任意地點自由放牧！</li>\n<li>樹果可在野外發現、於農田種植、作為堆肥以獲得加成，並透過交叉培育突變出新的樹果品種。</li>\n<li>將作物和樹果放入釀造台即可製作藥物道具。釀造的藥水治療效果更佳！</li>\n<li>世界中埋藏著待探索的古蹟建築。部分古蹟內有鍍金箱子，可能藏有珍貴戰利品或其他驚喜！</li>\n<li>在特定地點挖掘可疑的礫石或沙子即可發現化石，之後可使用復甦機器將其復活。</li>\n<li>可生成並對戰第 1 至第 9 世代的所有寶可夢，但若某些寶可夢尚未有模型，則會顯示為替身人偶。</li>\n<li>完整支援使用資料包與資源包製作自訂變體與幻創寶可夢。你可以透過&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcobblemon.com%252fguides%252fcustompokemon.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">我們的指南</a></span>了解具體做法！</li>\n<li><em><strong>……還有更多功能即將推出！</strong></em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>關於此整合包：</strong></span></h4>\n<p>Cobblemon 整合包旨在透過大量優化模組，讓你的 Minecraft 體驗更加沉浸，畫面與音效獲得提升，且運行效能優於原版 Cobblemon。此外，本整合包還新增了一些便利性功能，在不大幅改動原版 Minecraft 的前提下改善遊戲體驗。隨附的選用額外內容包含推薦的資源包與光影包，預設為關閉狀態。</p>\n<p><strong><em>注意：</em>&nbsp;Cobblemon 並沒有官方伺服器。</strong>&nbsp;你可以在我們的&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcobblemon.com%252fen%252fservers\" rel=\"nofollow\">網站</a></span> 或 Discord 的 #server-listings 頻道中找到公共伺服器列表，並將它們新增至多人遊戲選單。或者，你也可以向 <span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></a></span> 等主機商購買你自己的伺服器。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/bisect_banner2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2172\" height=\"360\"></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>技術細節：</strong></em></h5>\n<ul>\n<li>整合包與伺服器套件均可連線至原版 Cobblemon 伺服器與客戶端。</li>\n<li>建議配置至少 2.5 GB 記憶體運行。<em>使用 3 GB 或以上記憶體以獲得最佳效能。</em></li>\n<li>此整合包專為&nbsp;<strong>Fabric</strong> 設計，但 NeoForge 版本可在此<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/cobblemon-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">處</a></span>取得。<strong>建議遊玩 Fabric 版本，因其效能更佳。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>歡迎來到 Cobbled Farms！</strong></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/742/408/cobbled-farms-sign.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\"></p>\n<p>歡迎來到 <span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/cobbled-farms\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobbled Farms</a></span>，這是一款隨整合包附帶的單人世界，旨在向新老訓練家介紹 Cobblemon 的功能！你的任務是在當地居民外出期間，協助這個小型農業社區維護他們的美麗家園。幸運的是，他們留下了書籍，詳細說明瞭維護 Cobbled Farms 所需的一切知識，甚至教你如何在自己的世界或伺服器中建立屬於自己的農業社區！請務必在每次重大更新時回來查看教學世界的最新版本，以了解 Cobblemon 開發團隊可能新增的任何新功能。祝農耕愉快！</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/742/381/cobbled-farms.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"500\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/728750148007493723/1038387126661824512/divider.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><em><strong><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></strong></em></p>\n<p><em><strong>注意：</strong></em> Cobblemon 模組仍在開發中，並持續積極更新。許多功能目前仍處於開發階段或是暫代佔位符，直至完成。此外，我們也會持續打磨現有功能，使其更加精緻。未來還規劃了更多功能，包括但不限于 NPC、騎乘寶可夢、繁殖與建築結構等。</p>\n<p>加入我們的 Discord，追蹤開發進度、與團隊成員交流、提出問題，並抢先瞥見即將推出的新功能！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/discord_button.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"230\" height=\"51\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/728750148007493723/1038387126661824512/divider.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></strong></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>整合包內容</strong><em><br></em></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>此整合包允許客戶端連線至僅運行 Cobblemon 與 Fabric API 的伺服器。<br></em></strong><strong><em>若你想將這些模組用於個人用途，請前往其原始頁面下載，以支持作者們。</em></strong></p>\n<h4><strong>模組：</strong></h4>\n\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fadvanced-loot-info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">進階戰利品資訊</a></span>&nbsp;- 用於顯示戰利品表資訊的 EMI 外掛。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fambient-environment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">環境氛圍</a></span>&nbsp;- 為生物群系色彩增添色調雜訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fappleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a></span> - 顯示更多與食物相關的數值資訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbad-wither-no-cookie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bad Wither No Cookie - Reloaded</a></span>&nbsp;- 將許多喧鬧的全伺服器廣播音效改為僅本機可聞。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetter-advancements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更優進度</a></span>&nbsp;- 放大進度頁面&nbsp;並顯示進度資訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetter-ping-display-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更優延遲顯示</a></span>&nbsp;- 在玩家列表中以數字（毫秒）顯示每位玩家的延遲。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetter-third-person\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更優第三人稱</a></span>&nbsp;- 允許在第三人稱視角下獨立旋轉攝影機.&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgyazo.com%252fc225d60a5d871b3676e2835896a7e0ad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>權限</em></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcherished-worlds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">珍藏世界</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增世界書籤與搜尋功能。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcit-resewn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CIT Resewn</a></span>&nbsp;- 為資源包新增支援 MCPatcher 的自訂物品材質（CIT）。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fclumps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">經驗聚集</a></span>&nbsp;- 將鄰近的經驗球合併為單一實體以降低延遲。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcobblemon.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></span>&nbsp;- 將寶可夢加入你的 Minecraft。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcrafting-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">合成調整</a></span>&nbsp;- 允許使用按鈕旋轉、平衡或清空合成欄.&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgyazo.com%252f40a91e89ff83c69c3dce16fe8ca184c8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>權限</em></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcraftpresence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraftPresence</a></span>&nbsp;- 在 Discord 上顯示正在遊玩的遊戲資訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdynamiccrosshair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態準心</a></span> - 根據視角所對準的目標改變準心樣式。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增物品與配方檢視器，並與 JEI 整合。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI 附魔</a></span>&nbsp;- 提供基礎附魔資訊的 EMI 外掛。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi-ores\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI 礦物</a></span>&nbsp;- 顯示礦物在世界中生成資訊的 EMI 外掛。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi-professions-(emip)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI 職業 (EMIP)</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增職業工作站資訊的 EMI 外掛。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenchantment-descriptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">附魔說明</a></span>&nbsp;- 為附魔書的提示文字新增附魔說明。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenhanced-attack-indicator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">強化攻擊指示器</a></span>&nbsp;- 在更多動作時顯示攻擊指示器的進度條。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentityculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">實體剔除</a></span>&nbsp;- 跳過無法看見的實體渲染以提升效能。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">實體模型特徵 (EMF)</a></span>&nbsp;- 為資源包新增支援 OptiFine 的自訂實體模型（CEM）。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">實體材質特徵 (ETF)</a></span>&nbsp;- 為資源包新增支援 OptiFine 的實體材質特徵（ETF）。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffallingleaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">飄落樹葉</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增飄落的樹葉與雪花粒子效果。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffancymenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FancyMenu</a></span>&nbsp;- 客製化主選單。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fferrite-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FerriteCore</a></span>&nbsp;- 最佳化記憶體使用量。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmediatelyfast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ImmediatelyFast</a></span>&nbsp;- 最佳化即時渲染。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finvmove\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">InvMove</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增在開啟物品欄時仍可移動的功能。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finvmovecompats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">InvMoveCompats</a></span> - 為 InvMove 新增與 EMI 和 JEI 的相容性。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjust-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">足夠狀態說明 (JEED)</a></span>&nbsp;- 顯示所有狀態效果資訊的 JEI 外掛。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增物品與配方檢視器。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkrypton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Krypton</a></span>&nbsp;- 最佳化網路堆疊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flambdynamiclights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LambDynamicLights</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增動態光源。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flanguage-reload\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Language Reload</a></span>&nbsp;- 改善語言選擇選單。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flmd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let Me Despawn</a></span>&nbsp;- 允許撿起物品的生物消失。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flithium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lithium</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增大量遊戲最佳化。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmake_bubbles_pop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Make Bubbles Pop</a></span>&nbsp;- 使氣泡粒子破裂。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpages.medal.tv%252fcobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Medal</a></span>&nbsp;- 將 Medal.tv 與 Cobblemon 進行整合。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmonsters-in-the-closet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Monsters in the Closet</a>&nbsp;</span>- 高亮顯示阻止你睡覺的任何生物。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnetherportalfix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NetherPortalFix</a></span>&nbsp;- 修復多人遊戲中下界傳送門連結的錯誤.&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgyazo.com%252f40a91e89ff83c69c3dce16fe8ca184c8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>權限</em></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnot-enough-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Not Enough Animations</a></span>&nbsp;- 為原版動作新增更多動畫。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparticle-rain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Particle Rain</a></span> - 以粒子效果取代預設天氣，效能優於原版降雨。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparticular\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Particular</a></span> - 透過基於粒子的視覺效果增強環境氛圍。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpresence-footsteps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Presence Footsteps</a></span>&nbsp;- 讓腳步聲聽起來更好且更具動態感。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252freeses-sodium-options\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reese's Sodium Options</a>&nbsp;</span>- 改善 Sodium 的選項選單。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsatin-free-wakes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Satin Free Wakes</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增物品在水面移動時留下的尾跡，為 Wakes 的更新版本&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwakes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wakes</a>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fshulkerboxtooltip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ShulkerBoxTooltip</a></span>&nbsp;- 允許按住「Shift」鍵查看背包中潛影盒的內容物。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a></span>&nbsp;- 最佳化渲染。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium-extra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium Extra</a></span>&nbsp;- 在影片設定中提供更多選項。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium-extras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium Extras</a></span>&nbsp;- 為 Sodium 新增功能以提升體驗與效能。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodiumleafculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium Leaf Culling</a></span>&nbsp;- 提升樹葉渲染的效能。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium-shadowy-path-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium Shadowy Path Blocks</a></span>&nbsp;- 使用 Sodium 平滑路徑方塊的陰影。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstendhal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stendhal</a></span>&nbsp;- 改善書籍書寫的工具。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fswingthrough\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SwingThrough</a></span>&nbsp;- 允許穿透草叢等障礙物擊中敵人。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tips</a></span>&nbsp;- 在載入與暫停選單中新增提示。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftooltipfix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ToolTipFix</a></span>&nbsp;- 修復提示框超出螢幕範圍的問題。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvisuality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Visuality</a></span>&nbsp;- 為方塊與實體新增各種粒子效果。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fxaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a></span>&nbsp;- 顯示附近地形、玩家與實體的小地圖，並支援航點功能。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fxaeros-world-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's World Map</a></span> - 新增全螢幕世界地圖。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyosbr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Your Options Shall Be Respected (YOSBR)</a></span>&nbsp;- 防止設定檔被更新覆蓋。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4><strong>相依性：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252falmanac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Almanac</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 Let Me Despawn 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbalm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Balm</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 Crafting Tweaks 與 NetherPortalFix 所需。&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgyazo.com%252f40a91e89ff83c69c3dce16fe8ca184c8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>權限</em></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbisect-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting Server Integration Menu</a></span>&nbsp;- 由我們的託管合作夥伴所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbookshelf-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bookshelf</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 Enchantment Descriptions 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></span>&nbsp;- 許多模組用於顯示遊戲內設定選單所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></span>&nbsp;- 所有 Fabric 模組所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris Shaders</a></span>&nbsp;- 所有光影套件所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkonkrete\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Konkrete</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 FancyMenu 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmelody\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Melody</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 FancyMenu 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></span>&nbsp;- 允許在遊戲內設定 Fabric 模組。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fopen-loader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Open Loader</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 Tips 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fowo-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">o&omega;o-lib</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 Particular 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fprickle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prickle</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 Enchantment Descriptions 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium-options-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium Options API</a></span> - 由 Sodium Leaf Culling 與 Sodium Extras 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252funilib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">UniLib</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 CraftPresence 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyacl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YetAnotherConfigLib</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 Satin Free Wakes 所需。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>資源套件：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Motschen's Better Leaves</a></span>&nbsp;(<em>預設未啟用</em>) - 使葉片外觀更茂密的資源套件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>光影套件：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders - Reimagined</a></span>&nbsp;(<em>預設未啟用</em>) - 推薦的光影套件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong><em>Cobblemon 與寶可夢或 Minecraft 均無隸屬關係。</em></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:large\"><em><span style=\"font-size:18px\">M<span style=\"font-size:large\">inecraft 為 Mojang Synergies AB 之商標 ｜ Pok&eacute;mon 為 Nintendo、Creatures Inc. 與 GAME FREAK inc. 之商標。</span></span></em></span></p>",
